From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Martins <eduardo@martins.ws>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:16:40 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mfd: apple,pmic: Add the Acorn display PMU

Acorn is the iPhone X display PMU (ADT "display-pmu,acorn", I2C 0x2a on
i2c3), the successor of the iPhone 6/7 Chestnut with the same 8-bit
register file. Among its supplies is the touchscreen's.

Assisted-by: LLM
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml
index 47c31b32e..294a323aa 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mfd/apple,pmic.yaml
@@ -46,7 +46,9 @@ properties:
               - apple,agnes-pmic
               - apple,calpe-pmic
           - const: apple,spmi-pmic
-      - const: apple,chestnut-pmic
+      - enum:
+          - apple,acorn-pmic
+          - apple,chestnut-pmic
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
